    {
      "id": "dad760bf-33d9-438c-99ec-74afd238c51e",
      "title": "Observe a imagem, escute o áudio e perceba que agora a frase fala de mais de uma pessoa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5470eecf-0ea0-4c81-b6ca-32298427f231",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a frase mostra o gosto de duas pessoas.</p><p><strong>A Carla y a Julia les gusta viajar.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Carla e Julia gostam de viajar.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c9fb978064b4444db04ae92c07ee95f0_b05-carla-julia-viajar.png?Expires=1794099433&Signature=QGwvAOlRr25a7~myyxqh~NHQn1h04mYqnPW3cQn2YHIieAh7zYNMDa-A2rTSSbVhNyrBT~2udNScFMp-7NoOP0wN0vu81lIuXmgc92lCBtrwVQ5Y2bbZ7FwWSQHOG4IjdsHx3c9ZZELxE8n3ZxJT~K8lXNA2gyQay6i0fZDFKHBRtHEsu8VfAL-Wm7IFQ3STJxLsEIlFBBMyTXS9PIqcx6Cd212pK4pbAka2AvK1Bc9p0XQ5JYMV9KFU8o0EH43xj-NuN1Tm0Yq5Ru9nJilcPTMfDmxaCCy4RHNp8jm-JlgGheocetWQxQddRePJDmsQrbnqtVWwiziH0qnhLSNcsw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
