    {
      "id": "44d40718-ef37-4cf4-a73b-6ca7d512c30a",
      "title": "Leia a explicação curta e observe quantas pessoas entram na frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0c969c02-403d-40be-87ef-8744f7662975",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Les gusta</strong> entra quando a frase fala de <strong>duas ou mais pessoas</strong>.</p><p>No exemplo, Carla e Julia compartilham o mesmo gosto.</p><p>Ao ler, observe primeiro se aparece um nome sozinho ou um grupo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "97c1f80c-7b5d-40a9-bb38-3d04a36d01b7",
      "title": "Passe pelos cartões em sequência e note que a frase continua falando de mais de uma pessoa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a0023a4a-001b-498b-bd96-94a1fe563bb0",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 1</p><p><strong>A Carla y a Julia les gusta viajar.</strong></p><p>Em português: Carla e Julia gostam de viajar.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c0fcc726e1e442928181528727909746_b05-a-carla-y-a-julia-les-gusta-viajar.mp3?Expires=1794099433&Signature=Ir7OoCg8HohDeqlz9XcCUlnrl68eyAilRxeTjLigz3Sx2ko3dGVQ4yN8GLD2dcGr2DEEnr~nvJTVS2XuwzjzVwX8Ze-cLmiwKSAr0iEOd-0xMVQHCqOCLiB4Z~H78yjfbk8795alEFbSfiEf-h8RBg1nwys1r4fYho52ppdZ6PrBJkGeporxCYFh3HD8zYsNh8Vkw3pwbkWNxyeLGIWcn4FzRdFvrGONSQVHr9tHqS8MQcxrIBzjkvFrX1gpaH4jEy1ZS9JPiyZ5vb-lMqh0BP6cPuvDWTGVYd4E-pPcdinb8rZmbcUirdwP1cov6OidmPypW0-jjgW2D-Tzte89bQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "446ca507-65be-4ff8-8c97-3f0e0ca499c4",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 2</p><p><strong>A Sofía y a Paula les gusta escuchar música.</strong></p><p>Em português: Sofía e Paula gostam de ouvir música.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c2e2cbc790c74c3eaf635787aefcad1a_b07-a-sofia-y-a-paula-les-gusta-escuchar-musica.mp3?Expires=1794099433&Signature=JzyuStBVED~p3ocxxfWoE24ZXjW6tie8gOusTAdkVRB~bsP-erPzxVwMxquXjXpJFtDBGYAEDZSdTKH9CL8a0a4xga8hT2y6etQTp0kOj8g~oMPeOSO5MEg082d91sbjyYmafZTppaDb2FiOrykoQe3fEohCvtJVp7H7yDS6qyZu1btT6~wGH8Tw87JBWN25YG90qKMaLcQVEDgBNLGcBZM33fITFbMC7jtWPJgT-P7n-5I9mGGXIZaZC8DnT1HQqc2-Hc0lecf44wgpSQ9DMb~sIrQXvQ3Nu7WFzeyrdKSzXfdKW1eODT65Q80pF4sl8IIeCX8VQRcAAGphU~MdTg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
